# The game flow check (tests/battle3d/run.sh). Slice 3D-6: the Warden is the barrow's (the gate opens with Wren's token,
# Corwin steps aside), so the route is Wren (accept), the north-west patrol, the road patrol, Wren (the report), Brom
# (potions, then a rest and the refill: the Warden is not winnable without potions, docs/NEXT_SLICE_DIALOG.md finding 5),
# Corwin, the east exit, the waystone, the ring (the Warden's intro and battle), the ending, the credits, the title.
choose 0
talk wren
chase slime_a
chase slime_b
talk wren
talk brom
choose 0
talk brom
talk corwin
exit east
talk waystone
policy boss:good:1
goto 16 7
until title
expect warden_down=1 patrol_a=1 patrol_b=1 cleared=1
